      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T18:34:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A SoftReset in response to a SoftReset? That charger sounds really broken... what is it?  What did we receive that caused us to send the SoftReset?\n\nI guess if the PD port partner is a pure source (no DRP), we shouldn\u0027t send it a GetSinkCap. We should already know that from the SourceCap.\n\nSoftResets are to be sent whenever there\u0027s a protocol error.",
      "parentUuid": "39db18b7_ec1bc3f7",
